Z||000000||BroCar 87||02-14-2001||08:46 PM||||YUP, my V8 dreams are gone. My parents are forcing me to sell me fiero. I was told to decide which vehicle I want, the non-running duke, or the daily driving ford ranger. Hmmmm, daily driver is the one thats going to get me to and from work, and get me where I need to be going right! So, the duke has to go  <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/forum/frown.gif"> . I have made plans for this fiero for about 3 months now, and BOOM!!!!! they are smashed by the leaders of the house hold. I put up a post in the mall if anyone is interested. I am really mad that I have to get rid of it, but I have to do what I have to do huh!<BR>Here is my latest pic of it, kinda ironic that its on the back of a tow truck huh!  <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/uploads/BeastOnTruck_3.jpg"> ||||reg||9
